   222				// One entry per conversationId — that's the whole identity of a platform
   223				// conversation (the connection that delivered it is routing, not identity;
   224				// a reconnect changes it without changing the conversation). The ACL and
   225				// transcript read address it by conversationId alone, consistent with this.
